  "name": "Icy Ground",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/Water_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You conjure water over ground and freeze it into unnaturally slick ice.</p><p>Choose a point within <strong>10 spaces</strong>. Any creature within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of that point must make an opposed <strong>Reflexes</strong> check or fall <strong>Prone</strong>.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, standing up from <strong>Prone</strong> within the affected area also requires an opposed <strong>Reflexes</strong> check.</p><p>If a creature attempts to move or is pushed within the affected area while the spell is active, they must make the <strong>Reflexes</strong> check or fall <strong>Prone</strong>.</p><p>If they succeed, they move in a straight line until they come into contact with a barrier or exit the affected area.</p><p>If a creature is hit by an attack, it must also make <strong>Reflexes</strong> check or fall <strong>Prone</strong>.</p><p>If two creatures run into each other, they both must make a <strong>Reflexes</strong> check or fall <strong>Prone</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p>",
